Provision GCP for waxseal

Usage:
  waxseal gcp [command]

Available Commands:
  provision   Enable APIs and create the service account waxseal needs

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for gcp

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change without changing anything
      --no-color        disable colour
      --no-input        never prompt; fail if an input is missing
  -o, --output string   output format: text or json (default "text")
      --repo string     path to the repository (default ".")
      --verbose         log subprocess calls and debug detail to stderr
  -y, --yes             answer yes to confirmations

Use "waxseal gcp [command] --help" for more information about a command.
